WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Brother Changsheng

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,920
I couldn't have this money if it weren't for you

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,520
Several of my brothers died early and went to nursing.

4
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:08,100
Brothers settle accounts

5
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:09,740
Today's work

6
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,660
Who doesn't use his head

7
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,900
Don't cry. It's in the belt.

8
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,280
It's your turn to take it

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:17,220
You can’t miss a single point of Brother Changsheng

10
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,700
Do you know what’s going on in my family?

11
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,180
I used to eat meat from my mouth

12
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:26,160
I have to count the days. Now if I go into the mountains with you, you will share this much with me. I’ll get up, brother.

13
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,770
New Year's Eve

14
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:31,540
What are you doing, taking it back to buy meat for me?

15
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:32,620
Tear the flower cloth for my wife

16
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,020
I moved out and demolished your shabby house and built a special room.

17
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,140
From now on, as long as you are willing to follow me and work hard

18
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:44,700
The days will only become more prosperous as time passes. Brother Huo, from now on, I will hit you wherever you know.

19
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:45,900
Stop talking about poisonous things

20
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,980
Hurry up and go home to celebrate the New Year, smelling like death

21
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:48,900
Don't look for family members
